      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are some inconveniences, such as not being able to search one's own logs and not being able to change icons（ https://feedback.vrchat.com/website-bug-reports/p/canny-doesnt-update-icons-anymore ）, but I believe this is a limitation of VRChat's Canny integration and VRChat is working on improving this in a future update. Currently, the only way to go back is through notifications that come at the bell mark next to the icon in the interim.",
